<title>USA: Party City says to accelerate expansion.</title>
<headline>Party City says to accelerate expansion.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKAWAY, N.J. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Party City Corp on Tuesday said it plans to accelerate the rate at which it will expand its company-owned store base in 1997.</p>
<p>Sixteen leases have already been signed for store openings next year, and the firm anticipates opening up to 50 company-owned stores in 1997, up from previously announced plans of about 30 company-owned stores openings.</p>
<p>The specialty retailer of party supplies still intends to open 20 franchised stores in 1997.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
